(*NOTE* The attributions might be unclear. The question above was
written by me, Lizard. The text below was written by
gmitchel@garnet.acns.fsu.edu). Additional material by me follows the
quote.)

> In answer to your question about UFL, no I do not approve of UF's behavior.
> 
> What would I do?  More to the point, you might ask what I am doing?  I am
